Subject: [PATCH 2789/3799] soh: rename D_80115FF0 -> sUnusedEmptyDList

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: a display list holding only an end command, already commented unused
Defined in soh/src/code/z_actor.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/code/z_actor.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/code/z_actor.c b/soh/src/code/z_actor.c
index a43751655..62461137b 100644
--- a/soh/src/code/z_actor.c
+++ b/soh/src/code/z_actor.c
@@ -322,7 +322,8 @@ static Color_RGBA8 defaultPropsPrimaryColor = { 0, 255, 0, 255 };
 static Color_RGBA8 defaultPropsSecondaryColor = { 0, 255, 0, 0 };
 
 // unused
-Gfx D_80115FF0[] = {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was D_80115FF0: a display list holding only an end command, already commented unused
+Gfx sUnusedEmptyDList[] = {  // was D_80115FF0 [LLM:HIGH]
     gsSPEndDisplayList(),
 };
 
